Z||000000||grinthock||11-01-2001||06:54 PM||||Hey guys, I am having some flooding issues, I think it's time to get my injectors rebuilt.<P>Anyone know a place in Barrie (probably not so lets say toronto too), Ontario Canada that does this?  And how much?<P><BR>Justin<P>------------------<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fieroworld.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fieroworld.com</A>  The place to go for Fiero INFO! <BR>Home of my 87 GT and 85 GT<BR>Justin C.<BR>Engineer, Designer and<BR>Technical Trainer for Nortel Networks Business Products.||||reg||1
